<header class="page-header"><div><p class="eyebrow">BORÇ YÖNETİMİ</p><h1>Borçlar ve Taksitler</h1><p class="page-subtitle">Ödeme planınızı, kalan bakiyeyi ve kapanış tarihlerini takip edin.</p></div><%= link_to "Borç Ekle", new_finance_debt_path, class: "button button-primary" %></header><section class="finance-cards"><article class="metric-card"><span class="metric-label">Toplam borç yükü</span><strong class="value-negative"><%= dashboard_currency @total_debt %></strong></article><article class="metric-card"><span class="metric-label">Yaklaşan ödeme</span><strong><%= @upcoming.size %></strong><span class="metric-note">Önümüzdeki 30 gün</span></article></section><section class="panel"><div class="panel-header"><div><h2>Ödeme Takvimi</h2><p>Yaklaşan taksitler ve kalan borçlar.</p></div></div><% if @debts.any? %><div class="subscription-list"><% @debts.each do |debt| %><article class="subscription-row"><div><div class="subscription-title"><h3><%= debt.name %></h3><% if debt.next_payment_on && debt.next_payment_on <= Date.current + 30.days %><span class="template-badge custom">Yaklaşıyor</span><% end %></div><p>Kalan <%= debt.remaining_installments %> taksit · Tahmini kapanış: <%= debt.payoff_date ? l(debt.payoff_date) : "—" %></p></div><div class="subscription-actions"><strong class="value-negative"><%= dashboard_currency debt.remaining_amount %></strong><%= button_to "Ödeme Kaydet", pay_finance_debt_path(debt), params: {amount: debt.monthly_payment, paid_on: Date.current}, class: "button button-primary button-sm" if debt.active? %><%= link_to "Düzenle", edit_finance_debt_path(debt), class: "button button-secondary button-sm" %></div></article><% end %></div><% else %><div class="empty-state"><p>Henüz borç kaydı yok.</p></div><% end %></section>
